            '<p class="text-lg text-gray-600">cPanel and Plesk are the two best-known web hosting control panels. Both '
            'let you manage websites, email, databases and DNS from a browser instead of the command line, and both '
            'are sold as per-server licenses. They differ in the operating systems they support, how they are priced, '
            'and the ecosystem around them.</p>\n'
            '\n'
