            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">1. Control Panels: cPanel &amp; '
            'Plesk</h2>\n'
            '  <p>Your control panel is the central nervous system of your hosting server. <a href="/cpanel-license" '
            'class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">cPanel &amp; WHM</a> remains the premier choice for '
            'shared and reseller hosting due to its massive market recognition and rich plugin catalog. For agency '
            'workflows, developer-centric stacks, or Windows Server environments, <a href="/plesk-license" '
            'class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">Plesk</a> offers outstanding single-pane management with '
            'its built-in WordPress Toolkit.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">2. Web Acceleration: LiteSpeed '
            'Enterprise</h2>\n'
            '  <p>Dynamic PHP applications, particularly WordPress and WooCommerce, quickly exhaust memory pools on '
            'standard Apache web servers during traffic spikes. Deploying a <a href="/litespeed-license" '
            'class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">LiteSpeed license</a> replaces Apache seamlessly while '
            'reading existing <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">.htaccess</code> '
            'rules. With built-in LSCache, native HTTP/3, and anti-DDoS throttling, LiteSpeed dramatically boosts page '
            'load speeds and allows servers to host significantly more clients per node.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
