            'source</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Commercial, per '
            'server</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Connection handling</td><td '
            'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Process or thread per connection (MPM)</td><td '
            'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Event-driven non-blocking I/O</td></tr><tr><td '
            'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Apache config and .htaccess</td><td class="border-b '
            'border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Native</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 '
