            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Client Isolation and Security in '
            'Multi-Reseller Environments</h2>\n'
            '  <p>When multiple resellers share a single server, preventing cross-tenant interference is critical. '
