            'automated malware scanning, real-time Web Application Firewall (WAF) rule sets, proactive PHP defense, '
            'and distributed brute-force protection.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>Enterprise Backup Engine:</strong> A <a href="/jetbackup-license" class="font-semibold '
            'text-brand hover:underline">JetBackup license</a> enables automated, incremental, and encrypted offsite '
