            'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">mysqld process saturates CPU</td><td class="border-b '
            'border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Unindexed SQL query scans</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 '
            'px-4 py-3 align-top">mytop / slow query log</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 '
            'align-top">Add indexes, tune innodb_buffer_pool</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 '
            'py-3 align-top">High CPU from unknown IPs</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 '
            'align-top">Brute-force credential flood</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 '
            'align-top">access-logs / ss</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Deploy '
            'Imunify360 WAF / Fail2ban</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">High %wa '
            'I/O wait load</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Swapping or slow disk '
            'storage</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">iotop / vmstat</td><td '
            'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 align-top">Reduce swappiness, upgrade to NVMe '
            'SSD</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n'
            '  <p>To acquire genuine automated software licenses for your server infrastructure, browse our <a '
