            '<p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Enterprise Linux system administrators operating production web hosting '
            'clusters face sophisticated threats ranging from zero-day web application exploits to kernel privilege '
            'escalation attacks. Basic firewall configuration and password updates are no longer sufficient against '
            'modern multi-stage attack vectors. This guide covers 15 advanced hardening tricks and kernel parameters '
