            '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
            '    <li>Ensure all WordPress tables use the modern <strong>InnoDB</strong> storage engine rather than '
            'legacy MyISAM.</li>\n'
            '    <li>Set <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] '
