            'text-brand hover:underline">CloudLinux license</a> to prevent resource exhaustion crashes. For further '
            'assistance, submit a ticket to our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-brand '
            'hover:underline">Support Center</a>.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n',
