            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">2. What Is a cPanel Software '
            'License?</h2>\n'
            '  <p>A <a href="/cpanel-license" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">cPanel software '
            'license</a> is an authorization key that permits you to install and operate the cPanel &amp; WHM software '
            'suite on your own Virtual Private Server (VPS) or dedicated physical machine.</p>\n'
            '  <p>With a license, you gain access to <strong>WebHost Manager (WHM)</strong> with full root '
            'permissions. This allows you to create hosting packages, configure DNS servers, install custom web '
            'servers like <a href="/litespeed-license" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">LiteSpeed</a>, '
            'deploy PHP extensions, and manage unlimited individual client cPanel accounts.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">3. What Is cPanel Web '
            'Hosting?</h2>\n'
            '  <p>cPanel web hosting is an end-user hosting service provided by a web host (like SiteGround, '
            'Hostinger, or Bluehost). When you buy cPanel hosting, the company rents you a partitioned folder on their '
            'server with a pre-configured cPanel dashboard.</p>\n'
            '  <p>You can upload files, create MySQL databases, configure email inboxes, and install WordPress. '
            'However, you do not have root access, cannot access WHM, cannot modify global server settings, and do not '
            'pay for software licensing separately.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">4. Decision Guide: Which One '
            'Should You Choose?</h2>\n'
            '  <p>Choose <strong>cPanel Web Hosting</strong> if:</p>\n'
            '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
            '    <li>You want to launch 1 to 5 personal websites or small business pages without touching a Linux '
            'command line.</li>\n'
            '    <li>You prefer having a hosting company handle security patches, firewalls, and server hardware '
            'maintenance.</li>\n'
            '  </ul>\n'
            '  <p>Choose a <strong>cPanel Software License + VPS</strong> if:</p>\n'
            '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
            '    <li>You operate a digital marketing agency and host dozens of client websites on dedicated, isolated '
