            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Best Practices for Maximizing '
            'Your LiteSpeed ROI</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Deploying LiteSpeed Enterprise delivers immediate performance '
