            'Selection Decision Tree" width="800" height="450" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 '
            'shadow-sm bg-white" loading="lazy">\n'
            '  <figcaption class="text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Decision framework for matching VPS memory '
            'and worker processes to LiteSpeed plans.</figcaption>\n'
            '</figure>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Evaluating Your Hardware '
            'Constraints: RAM vs Workers</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">When sizing a <a href="/litespeed-license" '
            'class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">LiteSpeed license</a>, two hardware '
            'metrics dictate your minimum requirements:</p>\n'
            '  <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700">\n'
            "    <li><strong>Physical Server RAM:</strong> LiteSpeed's entry tiers (Starter, Site Owner, Web Host "
