            'and zero I/O penalties. OpenLiteSpeed, by contrast, requires a graceful server restart every time an '
            '<code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-sm text-gray-800">.htaccess</code> file is updated, '
            'making it impractical for shared hosting with non-technical customers.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Calculating Total Cost of '
            'Ownership (TCO) Over 3 Years</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">When evaluating whether a paid license is worth the '
