            'restart</code>\n'
            '  </div>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">4. Preventing Future Licensing '
            'Downtime</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">To guarantee that your web server maintains uninterrupted '
