            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Deep Troubleshooting: Advanced '
            'CLI Diagnostics</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">When standard troubleshooting commands do not immediately '
            "resolve a licensing error, inspecting LiteSpeed's low-level execution logs will pinpoint the exact "
            'failure mechanism. LiteSpeed logs detailed licensing events in <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 '
