            'py-0.5 rounded text-sm text-gray-800">/usr/local/lsws/logs/stderr.log</code>.</p>\n'
            '  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto my-4">\n'
            '    <code># Filter error log for license verification entries<br>grep -i "license" '
