            'verification endpoints<br>host licenbase.com<br>dig +short licenbase.com</code>\n'
            '  </div>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">If DNS resolution fails, update your server\'s resolver '
            'configuration in <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-sm '
            'text-gray-800">/etc/resolv.conf</code> to use reliable public resolvers like Google (8.8.8.8) or '
            'Cloudflare (1.1.1.1).</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Handling NAT and Multi-IP VPS '
            'Environments</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">In complex server configurations featuring multiple secondary '
            'IP addresses or private internal subnets, LiteSpeed may inadvertently attempt outbound license '
            "verification using an unwhitelisted secondary IP. To resolve this, configure your server's default "
            'routing table to route outbound traffic through your primary whitelisted IP:</p>\n'
            '  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto my-4">\n'
            '    <code># Check default route interface and IP<br>ip route show<br><br># Force outbound curl to bind to '
            'primary whitelisted IP<br>curl --interface your-primary-ip -Iv https://licenbase.com</code>\n'
            '  </div>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Need help diagnosing a complex network setup? Our 24/7 '
            'technical team is ready to assist via our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 '
            'underline font-medium">support desk</a>.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Emergency Recovery: Rebuilding '
            'the LiteSpeed License File</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">If your local license key file becomes corrupted due to sudden '
            'power loss, disk write errors, or migration glitches, you can perform a clean license rebuild in under 60 '
            'seconds without affecting website files:</p>\n'
            '  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto my-4">\n'
            '    <code># Step 1: Remove damaged license file<br>rm -f /usr/local/lsws/conf/license.key<br><br># Step '
            '2: Download fresh key using serial key or LicenBase client<br>curl -sL https://licenbase.com/update.sh | '
            'bash -s litespeed<br><br># Step 3: Test and restart LiteSpeed Web Server<br>/usr/local/lsws/bin/lswsctrl '
            'restart<br>/usr/local/lsws/bin/lswsctrl status</code>\n'
            '  </div>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">If you experience persistent network routing issues, contact '
            'our 24/7 technical team via the <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline '
            'font-medium">LicenBase helpdesk</a> for instant hands-on assistance.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Equip your servers with an affordable <a '
            'href="/litespeed-license" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">LiteSpeed '
            'license</a> and pair it with a reliable <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-brand-600 '
            'hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">cPanel license</a> for automated operations.</p>',
