            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The fatal flaw of switching to Nginx has always been rewriting '
            '<code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-sm text-gray-800">.htaccess</code> rules and breaking '
