            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Dynamic Content Acceleration: '
            'LSCache vs Nginx FastCGI</h2>\n'
            '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">While both servers handle static assets effortlessly, web '
            'hosting primarily revolves around dynamic PHP execution (WordPress, Laravel, PrestaShop). Here is how '
