            'often accounts for more than half of the total monthly cost of running a cloud virtual private server. In '
            'this comprehensive 2026 guide, we break down current retail pricing across all cPanel VPS tiers, evaluate '
            'real-world infrastructure expenses, and explore how automated IP licensing allows you to run genuine '
