            'text-sm"><thead><tr><th class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold '
            'uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600">Tier Name</th><th class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist px-4 '
            'py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600">Account Quota</th><th '
            'class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider '
            'text-gray-600">Standard Direct Retail</th><th class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist px-4 py-3 text-left '
