            'Budget Softaculous Hosting</h2>\n'
            '  <p>To avoid script timeout errors and corrupted MySQL database imports, inspect these six server '
            'parameters:</p>\n'
            '  <ol class="list-decimal space-y-3 pl-6">\n'
            '    <li><strong>PHP Memory Limit:</strong> Modern CMS tools like WordPress 6.x and WooCommerce require at '
            'least <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">memory_limit = 256M</code>. '
