            '    <li><strong>PHP Execution Timeout:</strong> Ensure the host allows <code class="rounded bg-mist '
            'px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">max_execution_time = 300</code> so large database schemas can be '
            'fully populated during automated installation.</li>\n'
