            'class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />\n'
            '  <figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">Three-step diagnostic and remediation '
            'workflow for LiteSpeed license failures.</figcaption>\n'
            '</figure>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Common LiteSpeed Licensing Error '
            'Messages</h2>\n'
            '  <p>When LiteSpeed fails to validate its license, inspecting <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 '
            'text-[0.85em] text-navy">/usr/local/lsws/logs/error.log</code> typically reveals one of the following '
            'diagnostic messages:</p>\n'
            '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
            '    <li><strong>[ERROR] License key is invalid or corrupted:</strong> Indicates the local <code '
            'class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">license.key</code> file is empty, expired, '
            'or has a mismatched hardware signature.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>[ERROR] Failed to contact license server:</strong> Indicates the server cannot establish '
            'an outbound TCP connection to the licensing gateway over port 443.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>[ERROR] Trial license expired:</strong> Indicates a temporary trial key has run its '
            'course and the server must be bound to a permanent automated IP license.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>[ERROR] Memory limit exceeded for license tier:</strong> Occurs if an entry-level license '
            'is installed on a server with more RAM than permitted by that tier.</li>\n'
            '  </ul>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Step 1: Check Current License '
            'Details from the CLI</h2>\n'
            '  <p>Connect to your server via SSH as root and query the LiteSpeed binary directly to inspect license '
            'attributes:</p>\n'
            '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># Check '
            'active LiteSpeed version, license serial, and expiration\n'
            '/usr/local/lsws/bin/lshttpd -V</code></pre>\n'
            '  <p>Review the output to see your active serial number, maximum worker count, and license expiration '
            'timestamp. If the output indicates expired status, proceed to network testing.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Step 2: Test Network Connectivity '
            'to Licensing Gateway</h2>\n'
            '  <p>LiteSpeed requires outbound HTTPS access to its licensing cluster to periodically refresh signed '
            'certificates. Test outbound connectivity:</p>\n'
            '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code>curl '
            '-Iv https://license.litespeedtech.com</code></pre>\n'
            '  <p>If the connection hangs or returns a timeout, check your firewall configuration (such as '
            'ConfigServer Security &amp; Firewall - CSF):</p>\n'
            '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># In '
            '/etc/csf/csf.conf, ensure TCP_OUT includes port 443\n'
            '# Then reload CSF:\n'
            'csf -r</code></pre>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Step 3: Force License '
            'Re-Verification and Key Refresh</h2>\n'
            '  <p>To force LiteSpeed to download a fresh cryptographic key file and verify your IP address with '
            'LicenBase, execute:</p>\n'
            '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># Force '
            'license update\n'
            '/usr/local/lsws/bin/lshttpd -r\n'
            '\n'
            '# Restart LiteSpeed gracefully\n'
            'systemctl restart lsws</code></pre>\n'
            '  <p>If you manage LiteSpeed inside cPanel &amp; WHM, you can also navigate to <strong>WHM &gt; Plugins '
            '&gt; LiteSpeed Web Server Plugin &gt; Version Management</strong> and trigger a graceful restart.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Preventing Recurrent License '
            'Dropouts</h2>\n'
            '  <p>To avoid unexpected licensing disruptions during unattended server updates:</p>\n'
            '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
            '    <li><strong>Verify Automated Cron Execution:</strong> Ensure the LiteSpeed daily update cron job is '
            'present in <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">/etc/cron.daily</code> so '
            'renewal certificates refresh automatically.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>Static IPv4 Assignment:</strong> Confirm your cloud VPS has a fixed, static IPv4 address '
            'that does not change upon hypervisor reboot.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>IP Re-issuance in LicenBase:</strong> If you migrate to a new hosting node, update your '
            'IP in the LicenBase portal before decommissioning the old machine.</li>\n'
            '  </ul>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Get Reliable, Uninterrupted '
            'LiteSpeed Licensing</h2>\n'
            '  <p>Licensing hiccups are often caused by unstable resellers or expired trial keys. LicenBase provides '
            'rock-solid automated IP licensing for <a href="/litespeed-license" class="font-semibold text-brand '
            'hover:underline">LiteSpeed Web Server</a> with 99.99% gateway availability, instant IP re-issuance, and '
            'wholesale pricing across all worker tiers.</p>\n'
            '  <p>Equip your production cPanel VPS with our discounted <a href="/cpanel-license" class="font-semibold '
            'text-brand hover:underline">cPanel license</a> and <a href="/imunify360-license" class="font-semibold '
            'text-brand hover:underline">Imunify360 license</a>. Check out our <a href="/deals" class="font-semibold '
            'text-brand hover:underline">bundle packages</a> for maximum server cost savings.</p>\n'
            '</section>',
