            'CPU percentage, memory allocation (RAM), disk I/O throughput (IOPS), and entry processes (concurrent HTTP '
            'connections).</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>CageFS Virtualized File System:</strong> Encloses each cPanel account inside its own '
            "private virtual filesystem jail. Users cannot view system configuration files, other users' home "
            'directories, or running system daemons.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>MySQL Governor:</strong> Monitors database usage in real time and automatically throttles '
            'slow or abusive queries before they exhaust database server connections.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>HardenedPHP:</strong> Backports critical security patches to legacy PHP versions (such as '
            'PHP 7.4, 7.3, and 5.6), allowing you to run older client applications securely without exposing the '
            'server to known CVE vulnerabilities.</li>\n'
            '    <li><strong>PHP / NodeJS / Python Selector:</strong> Allows end users to select their preferred '
