            '\n'
            '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
            '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">MySQL Governor: Real-Time Database '
            'Throttling</h2>\n'
            '  <p>Unindexed MySQL database queries are the number one cause of server crashes in shared cPanel '
