            '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># View '
            'real-time database usage by cPanel user\n'
            'dbctl --list\n'
            '\n'
            '# Configure governor mode to automatic throttling\n'
            'dbctl --set-mode=auto</code></pre>\n'
            "  <p>When an account exceeds its allocated database throttle limits, MySQL Governor pauses that user's "
            'queries for several milliseconds, preventing server-wide database lockups while keeping the site '
            'reachable.</p>\n'
            '</section>\n'
            '\n'
